sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as GitHub
  participant W as GitHubWatcher
  participant L as Ledger
  participant E as EffectRunner
  participant R as SessionRunner
  W->>G: GET the pull request, If-None-Match from refs
  G-->>W: mergeable_state dirty
  W->>L: pr-conflict(item, head)
  L-->>L: review to running, rounds unchanged for the first conflict, effect handover(fix)
  L->>E: effects
  E->>R: prepare the worktree on the branch, launch the fix session
  R-->>G: git push, through PushGate
  R->>L: exited(done, commits, pull request)
  L-->>L: running to review, effect schedule(poll)
  W->>G: GET the pull request and its check runs
  G-->>W: mergeable clean, checks success
  W->>L: pr-mergeable, checks-passed
  L-->>L: review stays, and under merge ready the merger may act
  L->>E: effects [github(merge, head sha)]
  E->>G: PUT merge
  W->>G: GET the pull request
  G-->>W: merged
  W->>L: pr-merged
  L-->>L: review to done, effects [settle, snapshot, remove-worktree, archive timer]
